# Admin (Vite) build-time environment variables (docs/07-DEVOPS.md §
# Environment variables). Vite only exposes variables prefixed `VITE_` to
# client code (`import.meta.env`); copy this file to `admin/.env.local` for
# local overrides — never commit real values.

# VITE_BOT_USERNAME: the Telegram bot's `@username`, used by the Login
# Widget on the login page (Phase 7 T7, ADR-005). Empty/unset hides "Log in
# with Telegram" — the widget also needs the admin's origin registered via
# `/setdomain` in @BotFather before it will render a real button.
VITE_BOT_USERNAME=
